  "body": "Agnes Baker deck only. Advanced. Seal (0 or -1).\n⭕ If Heirloom of Hyperborea is ready, after a \"0\" or \"-1\" chaos token has been resolved during a skill test on a {Spell} card you control: Seal that token on this card. (<i>Max 3 tokens sealed.</i>)\n⭕ When you would reveal a token from the chaos bag during a skill test on a {Spell} card you control, exhaust Heirloom of Hyperborea: Reveal a token sealed here instead, then release that token.",
